        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5008148492551318,
        "y0": 0.5618686868686869,
        "x1": 0.8994385962392769,
        "y1": 0.5757575757575757
      },
      "text": "ground zero. We used aerial photos taken 28 h after",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07971813476163578,
        "y0": 0.5795454545454546,
        "x1": 0.4806154911814172,
        "y1": 0.5934343434343434
      },
      "text": "the spread of ejecta from the Trinity test and to sug-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5009590099060458,
        "y0": 0.5795454545454546,
        "x1": 0.8683541491140727,
        "y1": 0.5934343434343434
      },
      "text": "the Trinity event to determine the radial extent.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07957254671582989,
        "y0": 0.5972222222222222,
        "x1": 0.4744042851566489,
        "y1": 0.6111111111111112
      },
      "text": "gest that trinitite was deposited by a rain of molten",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4996493470435049,
        "y0": 0.5972222222222222,
        "x1": 0.8541971842447916,
        "y1": 0.6111111111111112
      },
      "text": "These photos show the trinitite layer extended",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07987271103204466,
        "y0": 0.6148989898989898,
        "x1": 0.45106885947433173,
        "y1": 0.6287878787878788
      },
      "text": "droplets and puddling from the heat. Using our",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5009590099060458,
        "y0": 0.6148989898989898,
        "x1": 0.8669305938521242,
        "y1": 0.6287878787878788
      },
      "text": "to a radius of at least 300 m. We used a value of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07971813476163578,
        "y0": 0.6325757575757576,
        "x1": 0.46861958971210554,
        "y1": 0.6464646464646464
      },
      "text": "trinitite samples, we calculated some probable con-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49857285443474264,
        "y0": 0.6325757575757576,
        "x1": 0.5124522689121221,
        "y1": 0.6464646464646464
      },
      "text": "R",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5124522689121221,
        "y0": 0.6325757575757576,
        "x1": 0.8543308233123978,
        "y1": 0.6464646464646464
      },
      "text": "= 300 m for the radial extent of the trinitite.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07987271103204466,
        "y0": 0.6502525252525253,
        "x1": 0.4570002400018031,
        "y1": 0.6641414141414141
      },
      "text": "ditions of the nuclear explosion. We estimate the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0791879105412103,
        "y0": 0.6679292929292929,
        "x1": 0.46777399225172656,
        "y1": 0.6818181818181819
      },
      "text": "yield of the Trinity event was 9–18 kt, plus approx-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07989787432103375,
        "y0": 0.6856060606060606,
        "x1": 0.47023604897891774,
        "y1": 0.6994949494949495
      },
      "text": "imately 4.2 kt from the energy carried away by the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07970016454559525,
        "y0": 0.7032828282828283,
        "x1": 0.472662526797625,
        "y1": 0.7171717171717171
      },
      "text": "mushroom cloud. We calculated an average fireball",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07971813476163578,
        "y0": 0.720959595959596,
        "x1": 0.4680253446491715,
        "y1": 0.7348484848484849
      },
      "text": "temperature of 8430 K, the duration of heating at",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08007940903208614,
        "y0": 0.7386363636363636,
        "x1": 0.46390357671999466,
        "y1": 0.7525252525252525
      },
      "text": "approximately 3.1 s, and a crater depth of approxi-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07970016454559525,
        "y0": 0.7563131313131313,
        "x1": 0.4837704764472114,
        "y1": 0.7702020202020202
      },
      "text": "mately 4 ft. These numbers compare reasonably well",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0791879105412103,
        "y0": 0.773989898989899,
        "x1": 0.4845882303574506,
        "y1": 0.7878787878787878
      },
      "text": "with the real-time measurements calculated 60 years",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08007940903208614,
        "y0": 0.7916666666666666,
        "x1": 0.39336374070909286,
        "y1": 0.8055555555555556
      },
      "text": "ago and with unclassified published data.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07882124458263123,
        "y0": 0.827020202020202,
        "x1": 0.47446172377642465,
        "y1": 0.8409090909090909
      },
      "text": "If Trinity Site had not been cleaned up (bulldozed)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07955457649978936,
        "y0": 0.8446969696969697,
        "x1": 0.46489614598891316,
        "y1": 0.8585858585858586
      },
      "text": "by removing and/or burying a significant portion",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07987271103204466,
        "y0": 0.8623737373737373,
        "x1": 0.4470786362691642,
        "y1": 0.8762626262626263
      },
      "text": "of the trinitite, a field survey would provide the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07980800454133476,
        "y0": 0.8800505050505051,
        "x1": 0.4578341814427594,
        "y1": 0.8939393939393939
      },
      "text": "numbers needed for our calculations. Because an",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49957454905790444,
        "y0": 0.6686829364661014,
        "x1": 0.9027614219515931,
        "y1": 0.903945181104872
      },
      "text": "[Image: Im0]",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
